{
  "info": {
    "name": "Biblioteca — Prueba Tecnica Fullstack (Ezertech)",
    "description": "Coleccion completa de la API de prestamos.\n\nCOMO USARLA\n1. Levanta todo con `docker compose up --build`.\n2. Ejecuta **Auth > Login (ADMIN)**: el token se guarda solo en la variable {{token}}.\n3. El resto de peticiones ya salen autenticadas (auth heredada a nivel de coleccion).\n\nLa carpeta **Escenario completo** reproduce, en orden, el flujo de negocio de la prueba: prestar -> lista de espera -> devolver -> reserva notificada.\n\nLos correos enviados se revisan en MailHog: http://localhost:8025",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": "admin@anaquel.app",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "Admin123*",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "librarianEmail",
      "value": "lectura@anaquel.app",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "librarianPassword",
      "value": "Admin123*",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bookId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "loanId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
